{"seq":2,"slug":"grid-proximity-kring-polygon-cover","title":"网格化邻近计算：k-ring 扩展、多边形覆盖与格网预聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/grid-proximity-kring-polygon-cover","wordCount":2863,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格化邻近计算-k-ring-扩展-多边形覆盖与格网预聚合\">网格化邻近计算：k-ring 扩展、多边形覆盖与格网预聚合</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境业务里两个最费钱的地理问题形状完全不同。第一个是「找出这个仓库 5 公里内所有自提点」，半径是圆的，但数据库能快速查的只有索引键——把圆换算成一组离散网格单元就变成一次等值集合查询。第二个是「这个国家的服务范围内共有多少活跃商家」，范围是任意多边形，需要把多边形填满网格再数。共同点是：<strong>一旦空间被离散成有限集合，邻近、包含、聚合全部退化为集合运算</strong>，可以在 KV 存储、倒排索引、列存数仓上跑，而不必依赖几何库。</p>\n<p>网格化计算回答三个可枚举的问题：给定一个网格单元，它的<strong>第 k 环邻居</strong>有哪些；给定一个多边形，它<strong>覆盖</strong>哪些网格单元；给定一批带网格标签的记录，按网格<strong>预聚合</strong>能压到多小。H3 与 S2 是两个主流方案，一个是等面积六边形、一个是层次四叉投影。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;请求: 5km 内自提点&quot;] --&gt; B{圆还是多边形?}&#10;    B --&gt;|圆 + 半径| C[&quot;k-ring: grid_disk(cell,k)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|多边形| D[&quot;覆盖: polygonToCells&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;网格集合 (查询键)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;按 cell 查存储/倒排索引&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{需精确距离?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[&quot;返回候选&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[&quot;球面距离过滤&lt;br/&gt;剔除假阳性&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"请求: 5km 内自提点\"] --&gt; B{圆还是多边形?}\n    B --&gt;|圆 + 半径| C[\"k-ring: grid_disk(cell,k)\"]\n    B --&gt;|多边形| D[\"覆盖: polygonToCells\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"网格集合 (查询键)\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"按 cell 查存储/倒排索引\"]\n    F --&gt; G{需精确距离?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[\"返回候选\"]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[\"球面距离过滤&lt;br/&gt;剔除假阳性\"]\n    I --&gt; H</pre><p>关键量是<strong>环数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与网格分辨率的关系</strong>：H3 单元边长随分辨率每级缩小约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.645</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{7} \\approx 2.645</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.645</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（面积比固定为 7），S2 单元面积比固定为 4。给定目标半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，需要的环数由</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≳</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>cell_edge</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>res</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\gtrsim \\frac{r}{\\text{cell\\_edge}(\\text{res})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1036em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cell_edge</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">res</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>估算，但这个下界总是不够——六边形的 k-ring 是六边形而非圆，必须保证<strong>最远顶点</strong>也覆盖到半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。Uber H3 文档明确：<code>gridDisk</code> 返回「以该单元为中心、最大网格距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的所有单元」，几何形状比同半径的圆更「胖」，所以它天然是<strong>超集</strong>，安全但会多查。这决定了后面的架构：网格集合只做粗筛，精确判断永远留给几何。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>H3（六边形）</th>\n<th>S2（层次四叉）</th>\n<th>Geohash（矩形）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元形状</td>\n<td>六边形（12 个五边形例外）</td>\n<td>球面四边形</td>\n<td>经度切片矩形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次面积比</td>\n<td>7（边长缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.645</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 2.645</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.645</span></span></span></span></span> 倍）</td>\n<td>4（边长减半）</td>\n<td>32（base32 每字符）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等面积性</td>\n<td>近似等面积，纬度无关</td>\n<td>近似等面积</td>\n<td>严重随纬度畸变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻居定义</td>\n<td>6 个，环状均匀</td>\n<td>8 个四邻（含对角）</td>\n<td>边缘邻居需特殊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻近 API</td>\n<td><code>gridDisk</code> / <code>gridRing</code></td>\n<td><code>S2RegionCoverer</code></td>\n<td>手写前缀集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>出行定价、供需聚合、就近派单</td>\n<td>空间索引、区域覆盖、地图分块</td>\n<td>简单前缀邻近、日志分桶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论：<strong>圆/环形邻近选 H3</strong>（正六边形 6 邻居各向同性，无对角线畸变）；<strong>多边形覆盖与层次索引选 S2</strong>（四叉树天然支持「覆盖集合 = 若干不同层级单元」的自适应精度）。但两者产出的都是候选集，都可能<strong>丢失边缘命中</strong>，这是网格化最容易踩的第一个坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"k-ring-扩展与-ring-的区别-为什么邻近查询总要多一圈\">k-ring 扩展与 ring 的区别：为什么邻近查询总要多一圈</h2><p>H3 提供两个看起来相同的 API：<code>gridDisk</code> 返回「实心」的圆盘（含中心单元），<code>gridRing</code>（旧名 <code>kRing</code>）只返回<strong>第 k 环的边界单元</strong>。它们的关系是</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"disk(k) = ⋃_{i=0}^{k} ring(i),   |ring(i)| = 6i  (i ≥ 1),  |disk(k)| = 3k(k+1)+1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>disk(k) = ⋃_{i=0}^{k} ring(i),   |ring(i)| = 6i  (i ≥ 1),  |disk(k)| = 3k(k+1)+1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个闭式解很重要：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时正好 37 个单元，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时 331 个——<strong>单元数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 增长，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>。半径翻倍，查询键集合翻约 4 倍，等值 <code>IN</code> 查询的谓词长度也翻 4 倍。所以生产系统对「半径」有硬约束：先算清楚在该分辨率下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是多少，再决定要不要降分辨率换取更少的键。</p>\n<p>举一个可核验的数值：H3 官方分辨率表给出，res 9 的平均单元边长约 174 米，res 7 约 1.22 公里。若业务是「5 公里内」，用 res 9 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>5000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>174</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\approx 5000/174 \\approx 29</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000/174</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2611</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 29 \\times 30 + 1 = 2611</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2611</span></span></span></span></span> 个单元——一个谓词带 2611 个键，任何数据库都会放弃索引改走顺序扫描。降到 res 7，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>5000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1222</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\approx 5000/1222 \\approx 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000/1222</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>91</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 5 \\times 6 + 1 = 91</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">91</span></span></span></span></span> 个单元，可接受。<strong>分辨率选择不是精度问题，而是谓词基数问题</strong>——按目标键数上限反推分辨率、必要时降一级重算。</p>\n<p>两个语义细节：H3 有 12 个「五边形」单元（在二十面体顶点），邻居数不是 6 而是 5，<code>gridDisk</code> 跨其边界时集合形状不规则；<code>gridDisk</code> 是纯拓扑操作（沿邻居指针走）不做几何距离判断，因而不受反经线影响，但你若自己用球面距离过滤就必须处理经度 ±180 的绕回——这与 <a href=\"../spatial-data-model-crs/coordinate-reference-systems-projection\">坐标参考系与投影</a> 中「球面 vs 平面」的取舍同源。</p>\n<p>最后一步永远是<strong>精确过滤</strong>：候选集是超集，用真实半径剔除边缘的假阳性。直线距离直接上 haversine；驾驶时间则属路网问题，网格只做粗筛。把网格当最终答案、跳过精算，是环形查询第二大坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多边形覆盖-polyfill-的三种边界策略与层级选择\">多边形覆盖：polyfill 的三种边界策略与层级选择</h2><p><code>polygonToCells</code>（H3 v4 名称，旧版叫 <code>polyfill</code>）把任意多边形转换成一组网格单元。它的语义与 k-ring 完全相反：k-ring 是<strong>保证超集</strong>，polyfill 在多边形边界处必须在「宁可多」和「宁可少」之间选一个。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>H3 实现</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中心点法</td>\n<td><code>polygonToCells</code> 默认</td>\n<td>只收单元中心在多边形内的单元</td>\n<td>统计、近似面积；边界单元可能整体漏掉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全覆盖</td>\n<td><code>CONTAINMENT_FULL</code></td>\n<td>只要单元与多边形有交集就收</td>\n<td>「不得漏掉任何落入区域的点」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分覆盖</td>\n<td><code>CONTAINMENT_OVERLAPPING</code></td>\n<td>单元部分落在内部即收</td>\n<td>空间连接、候选生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bbox 加速</td>\n<td><code>CONTAINMENT_OVERLAPPING_BBOX</code></td>\n<td>用 bbox 近似后判定</td>\n<td>高分辨率大批量填充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>H3 v4 的性能变化很关键：老的 <code>polyfill</code> 用「从中心向外 BFS 扩展」算法，单元数一多就慢；v4.1 起提供 <code>polygonToCellsExperimental</code>，改用<strong>包围盒逐层扫描 + 只对边界做几何判断</strong>，官方 benchmark 显示在大多边形上快数倍到数十倍。对一个国家级多边形在 res 9 上填充，旧实现可能跑到超时，新实现进入秒级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;多边形 (GeoJSON)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;逐分辨率扫描 bbox 内候选&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{边界单元判定}&#10;    C --&gt;|中心在内| D[&quot;收&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|相交且策略为 FULL/OVERLAPPING| D&#10;    C --&gt;|相交但采用中心法| E[&quot;丢&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;单一分辨率集合&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;compactCells 折叠&lt;br/&gt;7 子 → 1 父&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;紧凑覆盖表示&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"多边形 (GeoJSON)\"] --&gt; B[\"逐分辨率扫描 bbox 内候选\"]\n    B --&gt; C{边界单元判定}\n    C --&gt;|中心在内| D[\"收\"]\n    C --&gt;|相交且策略为 FULL/OVERLAPPING| D\n    C --&gt;|相交但采用中心法| E[\"丢\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"单一分辨率集合\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"compactCells 折叠&lt;br/&gt;7 子 → 1 父\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"紧凑覆盖表示\"]</pre><p>层级选择是覆盖的第二个决策点。H3 的 polyfill <strong>只返回单一分辨率的单元</strong>；若要「大区域用粗单元、边界用细单元」的混合表示，需要自己 compact：<code>compactCells</code> 把 7 个同分辨率的子单元折叠成 1 个父单元，直到不可再折叠。S2 天然支持混合——<code>S2RegionCoverer</code> 直接产出不同层级的 cell 集合，由 <code>minLevel</code> / <code>maxLevel</code> / <code>maxCells</code> / <code>levelMod</code> 四个参数控制精度与规模的权衡。</p>\n<p>跨境场景最典型的用法是<strong>国家/行政区覆盖缓存</strong>：把「东南亚六国的服务范围」离线 polyfill 成 res 6/7 的 cell 集合存成一份配置，运行时靠 <code>cell IN (...)</code> 判断商家是否在服务区内，避免每个请求都跑 PostGIS 的 <code>ST_Contains</code>。代价是边界精度——一个国家多边形在 res 6（边长约 36 公里）上覆盖，必然包含若干境外单元，只适合粗筛。这与 <a href=\"../spatial-data-model-crs/geometry-geography-ogc-types\">几何与地理类型</a> 里 geometry/geography 选择的逻辑一致：网格是索引，几何是真相。</p>\n<p>第三个坑是<strong>覆盖的确定性</strong>：多边形退化成一条线、自相交、或带洞（holes）时的行为必须显式测试——带洞时中心点法会正确排除空洞内部单元，FULL 策略则会在空洞边界引入多余单元；顶点顺序（右手/左手规则）写反会让某些实现把「内部」判成「外部」，覆盖结果为空。这类 bug 在跨数据源拼接的 GeoJSON 上极常见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"格网预聚合-从-cell-标签到-o-1-邻近统计\">格网预聚合：从 cell 标签到 O(1) 邻近统计</h2><p>网格化真正的收益不在于单次查询更快，而在于<strong>让聚合变成主键查找</strong>。做法是给每条事实记录（订单、司机位置、商家）打上 cell 标签，并在数仓/OLAP 里按 cell 预聚合成物化视图；查询时只写一句 <code>SELECT SUM(parcels) FROM mv_delivery_by_cell WHERE dt = ? AND h3_cell IN (&lt;k-ring 集合&gt;)</code>。性能完全由<strong>环集合大小</strong>决定，而不是数据量——这正是前面强调分辨率选择的原因。生产上通常物化三层：res 5（区域）、res 7（城市级）、res 9（街区级），查询按半径挑层级，而不是每次都从最细粒度聚合。S2 的对应做法是<strong>前缀索引</strong>：每个 cell 编号前缀代表一个更粗区域，用字符串前缀 <code>LIKE &#39;89c25%&#39;</code> 或区间扫描就能聚合粗单元下所有细单元。BigQuery 内置了 <code>S2_CELLIDFROMPOINT</code> / <code>S2_COVERINGCELLIDS</code> 与 <code>H3_POLYFILL</code> 等函数族，可在数仓里直接做邻近聚合；PostGIS 侧则通过 <code>h3-pg</code>、<code>pg_s2</code> 等扩展或应用层计算。</p>\n<p>预聚合的三个设计约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>cell 标签必须在写入时确定</strong>，不能查询时算——这是把计算从读路径推到写路径的核心，落库即成索引键。</li>\n<li><strong>多分辨率标签会放大存储</strong>：一条记录带 res 5/7/9 三个标签等于三份索引。经验是用「一层主粒度 + 需要时上卷」而非全打标。</li>\n<li><strong>跨分辨率的父子关系不是严格包含</strong>：H3 一个父单元恰好含 7 个子单元，但<strong>子单元的中心未必落在父单元内</strong>（六边形细分后子六边形会探出父六边形边界）。所以「父单元聚合 = 其所有子单元的并集」严格成立，但「子在父的几何范围内」不成立。S2 的四叉细分则是严格几何包含，这是选 S2 做层级索引的又一条理由。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>结果语义要写进文档：网格聚合给出的是**「该 k-ring 覆盖区域内」的计数**，是超集近似，用于地图热力、供需看板、限流配额没问题；要精确的「半径 r 内」，仍需按真实距离二次筛选——除非把「网格距离」本身定义为业务邻近（很多出行/外卖系统就这么做，因为可解释、可复现、无浮点误差）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网格化把邻近与包含问题降维成集合运算：<strong>k-ring 是超集粗筛，polyfill 是覆盖近似，预聚合是主键查找</strong>，三者都只生成候选，精确性留给几何或距离函数。</li>\n<li>环数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 由半径除以单元边长估算，但 H3 的 k-ring 是六边形不是圆，必须多算一圈补偿；单元数按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3k(k+1)+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 增长，<strong>分辨率决策本质是谓词基数决策</strong>。</li>\n<li>H3 <code>gridDisk</code> 返回实心盘、<code>gridRing</code> 只返回边界环；H3 有 12 个五边形单元和边界畸变，跨它们时集合形状不规则。</li>\n<li>多边形覆盖有四种边界策略（中心点 / 全含 / 相交 / bbox），v4.1 的 <code>polygonToCellsExperimental</code> 用 bbox 扫描替代 BFS，大区域填充快数倍到数十倍。</li>\n<li>H3 的子单元中心可探出父单元边界，跨分辨率包含关系不成立；S2 的层次细分是严格几何包含，<strong>做层级索引/前缀聚合优先 S2</strong>。</li>\n<li>预聚合要求 cell 标签在写入时确定；把它当分区/聚簇键后，邻近统计的代价只与环集合大小有关，与数据量无关。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：<a href=\"../spatial-index-query-plan/spatial-index-rtree-gist-brin\">空间索引原理</a> 讲的是几何索引如何在数据库内部做「先过滤后精算」，本篇的网格化是同一思想在离线/分布式侧的投影——网格即索引键，B-tree 换成了 KV。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格化邻近计算：k-ring 扩展、多边形覆盖与格网预聚合","id":"网格化邻近计算-k-ring-扩展-多边形覆盖与格网预聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"k-ring 扩展与 ring 的区别：为什么邻近查询总要多一圈","id":"k-ring-扩展与-ring-的区别-为什么邻近查询总要多一圈"},{"level":2,"text":"多边形覆盖：polyfill 的三种边界策略与层级选择","id":"多边形覆盖-polyfill-的三种边界策略与层级选择"},{"level":2,"text":"格网预聚合：从 cell 标签到 O(1) 邻近统计","id":"格网预聚合-从-cell-标签到-o-1-邻近统计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"H3 与 S2 网格模型：六边形/四叉层级、单元 ID 与分辨率取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/h3-s2-grid-model-resolution"},"next":{"title":"邻近服务 API 与热格分片：边界跨格、分页与容量倾斜治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/nearby-service-api-hotcell-sharding"}}